      "decay_3d_ic": 0.038262,
      "decay_3d_icir": 0.115472,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Passes benchmark daily paper IC and ICIR gates. Elevated-dispersion activation leaves 1,133 valid IC dates; small cross-asset universe warrants conservative uncertainty interpretation. Three-day paper metrics are also positive. Deterministic library correlation audit remains pending.",
